<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper C · Answer guide</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Paper C · Answer guide</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 20 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. What will the woman do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 姑妈今晚住我们家，客房还没整理。</p><p class="cn">female · 你去车站接她吧，房间我来收拾。水果弟弟已经买好了。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我现在去车站。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去车站接人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 整理客房</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去买水果</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The woman takes responsibility for the guest room.</p><p class="cn">女生负责整理客房。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 房间我来收拾</p><ul><li>A: The man is leaving for the station.<br>去车站接人的是男生。</li><li>C: The younger brother has already bought the fruit.<br>水果已经由弟弟买好。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. When will the family begin dinner?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 舅舅的火车六点到站，是不是六点就吃晚饭？</p><p class="cn">male · 不行，从车站到家还要四十分钟。我们七点开饭，先让他把行李放好。</p><p class="cn">female · 好，七点一起吃。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 晚上六点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 晚上七点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上六点四十</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>They explicitly agree on dinner at seven.</p><p class="cn">他们明确约定七点开饭。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我们七点开饭</p><ul><li>A: Six is the train arrival time.<br>六点是火车到站时间。</li><li>C: Six forty is the expected arrival home, before dinner.<br>六点四十是预计到家时间，不是开饭时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. How often does the speaker have this meal at Grandma’s home?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我们平时各自在家吃饭，每个月的第一个和第三个星期日，才去奶奶家一起吃。我每个月去两次，不是每个星期都去，也不是每天去。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每月两次</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 每周两次</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 每天一次</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>He explicitly states two visits per month.</p><p class="cn">说话者明确每月去两次。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我每个月去两次</p><ul><li>B: The interval is a month, not a week.<br>两次的单位是每月，不是每周。</li><li>C: He says it is not a daily visit.<br>他明确不是每天去。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Where can the woman ride on a flat route during her free time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 我周日下午有空，想骑一段平路，不想上坡。</p><p class="cn">male · 山边的路一直能骑，可是有坡；学校里的平路周日不开。河边的平路下午开放。</p><p class="cn">female · 那就去河边。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 山边</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 河边</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 学校里面</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The riverside route is both flat and open on Sunday afternoon.</p><p class="cn">河边既是平路，又在周日下午开放。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 河边的平路下午开放</p><ul><li>A: The hillside route has the slope she wants to avoid.<br>山边有她想避开的坡。</li><li>C: The school route is closed on Sunday.<br>学校的平路周日不开。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Which approach does Xiaolin’s experience support choosing?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 小林以前骑车总要和朋友比快。昨天他没有看用时，慢慢骑了一圈，还停下拍了几张照片。回家以后他说，这次比以前轻松，以后还想这样骑。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每次都争取骑得最快</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 轻松骑车，不只比速度</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 骑车时一直不许停</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>His relaxed ride and positive reaction support a less competitive approach.</p><p class="cn">轻松骑行后感觉更好，支持不只比速度。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 慢慢骑了一圈，还停下拍了几张照片</p><ul><li>A: Racing is the earlier pattern, not the one he now wants to repeat.<br>争快是以前的方式，不是这次想继续的方式。</li><li>C: Stopping for photos is part of the enjoyable outing.<br>他这次会停下拍照，并非一直不停。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. Where will the man wait?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我们在老菜市场门口见吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 今天要去的是社区新市场，在邮局旁边。老菜市场已经关了，别去错。</p><p class="cn">male · 明白，我在新市场东门等你。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 老菜市场门口</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 邮局里面</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 新市场东门</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The final stated meeting point is the new market’s east entrance.</p><p class="cn">最后明确在新市场东门等。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我在新市场东门等你</p><ul><li>A: The old market is closed and explicitly ruled out.<br>老市场已经关门，不是目的地。</li><li>B: The post office is a landmark, not the meeting place inside it.<br>邮局只是旁边的地标，没有约定进入邮局。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. How will they travel to the market?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 公交车去市场要绕路，得坐半个小时。</p><p class="cn">male · 从这里走过去只要十分钟，我今天也没带自行车。</p><p class="cn">female · 那我们走路去，买好东西再看怎么回来。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 坐公交车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 骑自行车</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 走路</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>They decide to walk to the market.</p><p class="cn">他们决定走路去市场。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 那我们走路去</p><ul><li>A: The bus takes a detour and is not chosen.<br>公交绕路，没有被选中。</li><li>B: The man has no bicycle with him.<br>男生今天没有带自行车。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. What should the man do first after leaving the station?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 市场南门前修路，从车站出来怎么走？</p><p class="cn">female · 先沿河向北走，到了小桥再过河。过桥后就是市场北门，不要从南门硬走过去。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，先往北。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 立即过桥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 直接走向南门</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 沿河向北走</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Walking north beside the river comes before crossing the bridge.</p><p class="cn">先沿河向北，之后才到桥上过河。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 先沿河向北走，到了小桥再过河</p><ul><li>A: He must first reach the bridge by walking north.<br>不能马上过桥，要先往北到桥边。</li><li>B: The south entrance is obstructed by road works.<br>南门前修路，明确不要直接硬走。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which service meets the man’s arrival and payment needs?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 去市场的班车九点四十到，只收现金。公交车九点五十到，可以刷交通卡。</p><p class="cn">male · 我十点前要到，身上只有交通卡，没有现金，坐公交吧。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 市场班车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两种车都一定不能坐</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 公交车</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The bus arrives before ten and accepts his transport card.</p><p class="cn">公交十点前到，也能用他的交通卡。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 公交车九点五十到，可以刷交通卡</p><ul><li>A: The market shuttle requires cash he does not have.<br>班车只收他没有带的现金。</li><li>B: The bus meets both stated conditions.<br>公交满足两个条件，不能说都不能坐。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. What will they do this Sunday?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 周日风太大，带客人去放风筝的事怎么办？</p><p class="cn">female · 先在家教大家做纸风筝吧，做好留着，下星期天气合适再出去放。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，周日就在家做。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 照常去外面放风筝</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先在家做纸风筝</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把活动全部取消不再做</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>They replace outdoor flying with making paper kites at home.</p><p class="cn">周日改成在家做纸风筝。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 先在家教大家做纸风筝吧</p><ul><li>A: Flying outside is postponed until suitable weather.<br>外出放风筝推迟到天气合适时。</li><li>C: They keep an indoor activity rather than cancelling everything.<br>保留了室内活动，没有全部取消。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. How many boxes of biscuits will be given as gifts?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 姑妈和叔叔两家都来，每个人都送一盒饼干吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 不用按人数送，每家一盒，一共两盒。茶叶另外带一袋，留在家里大家一起喝。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三盒</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>There are two recipient households and the confirmed total is two boxes.</p><p class="cn">两家每家一盒，明确一共两盒。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 每家一盒，一共两盒</p><ul><li>B: One box would cover only one household.<br>一盒只够送给一家。</li><li>C: The separate bag of tea is not another box of biscuits.<br>另外的茶叶不属于饼干盒数。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Which cup matches the uncle’s stated preference?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 这三种杯子，你想送哪一种给叔叔？</p><p class="cn">female · 叔叔喜欢小杯子，而且一定要有把手。这只小号带把手的就合适，大号和没把手的都不要。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 带把手的小杯子</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 带把手的大杯子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 没有把手的小杯子</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The small cup with a handle matches the stated preference.</p><p class="cn">小而有把手同时符合偏好。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 叔叔喜欢小杯子，而且一定要有把手</p><ul><li>B: A large cup fails the size preference.<br>大杯子不符合喜欢小杯子的偏好。</li><li>C: The handle is explicitly required.<br>材料明确要求有把手。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. What is the stated price of the packaged gift set?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 茶叶一小袋六块，三袋散着买十八块。装成这套礼盒要二十五块，盒子和包装都算在里面。</p><p class="cn">male · 我要这套包好的礼盒，送给客人。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二十五块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十八块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 六块</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The complete packaged set is priced at twenty-five.</p><p class="cn">完整包装礼盒标价二十五块。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 装成这套礼盒要二十五块</p><ul><li>B: Eighteen is for three loose bags without this packaging.<br>十八块是三袋散装茶叶的价格。</li><li>C: Six is the price of one small bag.<br>六块只是一小袋的单价。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. Which gift meets the journey-related requirements?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 客人明天坐火车走，想带一件轻又不容易碎的礼物。</p><p class="cn">female · 玻璃杯不合适，大花瓶也重。围巾很轻，折起来就能放进包里，不用担心打碎。</p><p class="cn">male · 那选围巾。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 围巾</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 玻璃杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大花瓶</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The scarf is light and not breakable like the glass gifts.</p><p class="cn">围巾轻，也不像玻璃制品那样易碎。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 围巾很轻，折起来就能放进包里，不用担心打碎</p><ul><li>B: The glass cup does not meet the non-breakable requirement.<br>玻璃杯不符合不容易碎的要求。</li><li>C: The vase is heavy as well as breakable.<br>大花瓶既重又容易碎。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. What will the woman prepare before the guests arrive?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 客人六点来，你几点能到家？</p><p class="cn">male · 我六点才到，来不及准备。</p><p class="cn">female · 我五点就到。那我先把客厅椅子摆好，你回来陪客人聊天，晚饭弟弟已经订了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 重新订晚饭</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 把客厅椅子摆好</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 等男生到家再准备座位</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>She is home earlier and will arrange the chairs.</p><p class="cn">她先到家，负责把椅子摆好。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 那我先把客厅椅子摆好</p><ul><li>A: The younger brother has already ordered dinner.<br>弟弟已订晚饭，不需要重新订。</li><li>C: She plans to prepare before the man gets home.<br>她会提前准备，不是等男生回来。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. What change is forecast for the afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 早上外面几乎没有风，可是预报说下午风会大很多，晚上也不会马上停。今天气温变化不大，想骑车的同学要注意下午的风，别只看早上的天气。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 风会完全停下来</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 会比早上热很多</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 风会明显变大</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The forecast is for much stronger afternoon wind.</p><p class="cn">预报说下午风会大很多。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 下午风会大很多</p><ul><li>A: The wind is not expected to stop immediately, even at night.<br>晚上也不会马上停，更不能说下午完全停。</li><li>B: The temperature is said to change little.<br>材料说气温变化不大，不是明显更热。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. Why are they writing the cards indoors?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 今天为什么把写贺卡的桌子搬进屋？外面也没有下雨啊。</p><p class="cn">male · 风太大，纸一直被吹走。我们在屋里写完，再拿出去给客人看，时间还是三点。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 外面正在下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 屋外的活动要到晚上才开始</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 外面的风会吹走纸</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Wind blows the paper away, so they move indoors.</p><p class="cn">大风会吹走纸，因此改在屋里写。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 风太大，纸一直被吹走</p><ul><li>A: The woman explicitly says there is no rain.<br>女生明确说外面没有下雨。</li><li>B: The activity remains at three, not an evening start.<br>时间仍是三点，没有推迟到晚上。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. Which plan fits the water availability during this outing?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 明天骑车在广场集合，那里能装水吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 没有饮用水，来以前要在家装好一瓶。路上商店也没开，别到了广场才找水。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我出门前装好。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 到广场再装水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 到路上商店再买水</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 出门前在家装水</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Home is the available place before the meeting, unlike the square and closed shops.</p><p class="cn">集合前应在家装水，广场无水且商店未开。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 来以前要在家装好一瓶。路上商店也没开</p><ul><li>A: The square has no drinking-water supply.<br>广场没有饮用水。</li><li>B: The shops on the route are closed.<br>路上商店还没开。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What did the family do immediately after dinner?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 去年中秋，我们先给住在外地的姐姐打电话。吃完晚饭，全家一起分月饼。后来月亮出来了，才到阳台拍照。姐姐看了照片，说好像也和我们坐在一起。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一起分月饼</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先给姐姐打电话</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 马上去阳台拍照</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Sharing mooncakes directly follows dinner in this family’s sequence.</p><p class="cn">这家人的安排是晚饭后紧接着分月饼。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 吃完晚饭，全家一起分月饼</p><ul><li>B: The phone call happens before dinner.<br>电话在晚饭之前打。</li><li>C: Photos come later when the moon appears.<br>等后来月亮出来才拍照。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. How does Grandma appear to feel after the video call starts?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 哥哥出差不能回来，奶奶起初说今年中秋少了一个人。后来我们接通视频，哥哥也在屏幕那边吃饭。奶奶一直笑，还请我们把手机放近一点儿，好让她看清哥哥。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 很高兴能和哥哥联系</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 完全不想看哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 生气得不肯吃饭</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Smiling and wanting a closer view support pleasure at the contact.</p><p class="cn">一直笑又想看清，支持能联系上家人的高兴。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 奶奶一直笑，还请我们把手机放近一点儿</p><ul><li>B: She asks to see him more clearly.<br>她想看得更清楚，不是不想看。</li><li>C: No anger or refusal to eat is reported.<br>材料没有说生气或拒绝吃饭。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 25 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What does the mother ask Xiaozhou to do first?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">给小周的留言<br>客人上午就到，玄关的鞋子已经收好了，水果也洗过了。请你回家后先把餐桌上的课本放进书柜，给客人留出喝茶的地方。不要把书放到阳台，那里下午风大。<br>妈妈</p></div><p class="note">玄关: entrance area</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 把课本放进书柜</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 再洗一次水果</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把课本搬到阳台</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The requested task is to put the textbooks in the bookcase.</p><p class="cn">要求先把课本放进书柜。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 先把餐桌上的课本放进书柜</p><ul><li>B: The fruit has already been washed.<br>水果已经洗过。</li><li>C: The note explicitly says not to put the books on the balcony.<br>留言明确不要放阳台。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. When does the formal video conversation begin?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家庭视频安排<br>今晚七点先吃饭，七点半检查手机和网络，八点正式和外地舅舅视频聊天。八点半再给他看客人带来的照片。请不要把设备检查时间当作正式聊天的开始时间。</p></div><p class="note">设备: equipment</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 晚上七点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 晚上八点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上八点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The formal conversation starts at eight.</p><p class="cn">正式聊天八点开始。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 八点正式和外地舅舅视频聊天</p><ul><li>A: Seven thirty is for checking the phone and connection.<br>七点半是检查手机和网络。</li><li>B: Eight thirty is when they start showing photos.<br>八点半是之后展示照片的时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How long does Xiao’an spend tidying each evening under the current arrangement?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小安的家务记录<br>客人住在我家这几天，我每天晚饭后整理客厅十五分钟。以前妈妈建议我整理半小时，现在家人分工以后，我只要十五分钟就能完成。客人走后会再讨论新的分工，不用每天做同样的事。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十五分钟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 半小时</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一小时</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The current routine takes fifteen minutes each evening.</p><p class="cn">现在每天晚饭后整理十五分钟。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我每天晚饭后整理客厅十五分钟</p><ul><li>B: Half an hour was an earlier suggestion before sharing the work.<br>半小时是分工前的建议。</li><li>C: One hour is not stated.<br>材料没有说需要一小时。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Which riding period fits Xiaolin’s arrival and both opening windows?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周日骑行信息<br>公园骑行区上午十点到十一点开放；门口租车处九点半到十点半营业，车可以在十一点归还。小林九点五十分到公园，想当天先租车再进骑行区，上午十一点必须离开。</p></div><p class="note">租: rent</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九点半到十点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十点到十点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十一点到十一点半</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>At ten he has arrived, can rent a bike, and the riding area is open.</p><p class="cn">十点已到场，也能租车，骑行区已开放。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 公园骑行区上午十点到十一点开放</p><ul><li>A: He has not arrived at nine thirty and the riding area is still closed.<br>九点半他还没到，骑行区也没有开放。</li><li>C: At eleven he must leave and the riding window ends.<br>十一点他必须离开，骑行区也结束开放。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. What does Xiaolin’s choice suggest mattered most on this outing?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林的骑行记录<br>妹妹刚学会骑车，跟不上原来那组快车队。我今天没有跟车队出发，而是陪妹妹慢慢骑，到她想休息的时候就一起停下。朋友问我骑了多远，我先给他看了和妹妹的合影。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 陪家人一起骑车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一定要比朋友骑得远</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 完全不愿意停下来</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>He changes his usual group plan to share the ride with his sister.</p><p class="cn">他改变原来的车队安排来陪妹妹，支持重视陪伴。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 而是陪妹妹慢慢骑，到她想休息的时候就一起停下</p><ul><li>B: Distance is not what he emphasizes when asked.<br>被问距离时他先展示合影，并未强调比远。</li><li>C: He explicitly stops when his sister wants a rest.<br>妹妹想休息时会一起停下。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Where should shoppers go for this week’s market?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">社区市场通知<br>原来在旧车库里的周末市场暂停一周。本周的摊位搬到社区活动室旁边的小院，入口在邮局对面。不要再到旧车库排队，那里本周只接收工作人员的物资。</p></div><p class="note">摊位: market stall</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 旧车库里面</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 邮局营业厅里面</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 社区活动室旁的小院</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The temporary stalls are in the courtyard beside the activity room.</p><p class="cn">临时摊位在活动室旁边的小院。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 本周的摊位搬到社区活动室旁边的小院</p><ul><li>A: The former location is not open to shoppers this week.<br>旧位置本周不对顾客开放。</li><li>B: The post office is across from the entrance, not the market venue.<br>邮局在入口对面，不是市场设在营业厅。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Which transport does the host ask the guest to use from North Station?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">给来访客人的交通说明<br>请从北站坐地铁二号线，到市场站下车。我们会在车站出口接你，行李多也不用走远路。不要买去南站的长途汽车票，南站离我们家很远。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去南站的长途汽车</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 自己骑车过来</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 地铁二号线</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The host specifically requests subway line two from North Station.</p><p class="cn">主人明确要求从北站坐地铁二号线。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请从北站坐地铁二号线</p><ul><li>A: The message warns against buying the long-distance bus ticket.<br>留言提醒不要买去南站的汽车票。</li><li>B: No cycling instruction is given.<br>没有要求客人自己骑车。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What is the first step after leaving the station?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">市场绕行说明<br>南门前正在修路。从车站出来，请先走地下通道到街对面，再顺着河边走到小桥。过桥后就是临时市场的北入口。不要在地下通道出口直接向南，那边围起来不能通行。</p></div><p class="note">地下通道: underpass</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 马上向南走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先过河上的小桥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 走地下通道到街对面</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The underpass is the first required part of the detour.</p><p class="cn">绕行第一步是通过地下通道。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请先走地下通道到街对面</p><ul><li>A: The southward route is blocked.<br>向南的路围起来不能通行。</li><li>B: The bridge comes after the underpass and riverside path.<br>先通道再河边走，之后才到桥。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Which route meets the collection-point and cycling requirements?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">市场取货路线<br>甲路线穿过步行街，不准骑车，只能下车推着走，终点是东门。乙路线沿外圈车道直达南门，可以一路骑行。小周的货在南门，他希望不用下车推车就到取货处。</p></div><p class="note">步行街: pedestrian street</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲路线</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 两条都直接到南门</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙路线</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Route B reaches the correct gate while allowing continuous cycling.</p><p class="cn">乙既到南门，又可以一直骑到取货处。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 乙路线沿外圈车道直达南门，可以一路骑行</p><ul><li>A: Route A ends at the wrong gate and requires pushing the bike.<br>甲到东门且需要推车，两点都不符。</li><li>B: Only route B is described as going directly to the south gate.<br>只有乙直接到南门，不能说两条都是。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. How will participants now join the seven-o’clock event?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">中秋社区活动更新<br>大风影响了户外布置，原定晚上七点在广场听故事，改为同一时间的视频故事会。大家在家参加，活动链接下午发到报名群，不用到广场，也不用去活动室占座。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 到广场听故事</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 在家参加视频故事会</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先去活动室占座</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The update changes participation to a video session from home.</p><p class="cn">新安排是在家参加视频故事会。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 大家在家参加，活动链接下午发到报名群</p><ul><li>A: The outdoor square event has been replaced.<br>广场的户外活动已经被替代。</li><li>C: The notice explicitly says not to reserve a seat in the activity room.<br>通知明确不用去活动室占座。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How many greeting cards are on the order?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">礼品取货单<br>茶叶两份，贺卡六张，鲜花三束。六位客人每人收到一张贺卡；茶叶和鲜花另按家庭分。请按单取货，不要因为有三束花就只带三张卡，卡片上的名字已经写好了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三张</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六张</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两张</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The order lists six greeting cards.</p><p class="cn">取货单列出贺卡六张。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 贺卡六张</p><ul><li>A: Three is the number of flower bouquets.<br>三是鲜花束数，不是卡片数。</li><li>C: Two is the number of tea gifts.<br>两份指茶叶。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which gift matches Grandma’s stated wish?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">给奶奶选礼物<br>奶奶说自己不缺茶叶，也不想要只有图片的画册。她最想要一本字比较大、能跟着唱的歌曲书。小周记下了这个愿望，准备在亲戚来访前去书店找。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 只有图片的画册</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 茶叶礼盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大字歌曲书</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The stated wish is for a songbook with large print.</p><p class="cn">愿望明确是大字歌曲书。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 她最想要一本字比较大、能跟着唱的歌曲书</p><ul><li>A: She says she does not want a picture-only album.<br>她明确不想要只有图片的画册。</li><li>B: She says she has enough tea.<br>她说自己不缺茶叶。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. Which delivery charge applies to Xiaozhou’s order?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">花店送货单<br>鲜花四十五元。送到学校门口加五元，送到家加八元。小周让店员送到学校，自己放学后带回家，所以这张单总共五十元。不要按送到家的运费付款。</p></div><p class="note">运费: delivery charge</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 八元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五元</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>School delivery costs five yuan according to the preceding price line.</p><p class="cn">前面价格行说明送到学校的运费是五元。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 小周让店员送到学校</p><ul><li>A: Eight is for home delivery, which is not ordered.<br>八元是未采用的到家运费。</li><li>B: Fifty is the complete order total, not the delivery component.<br>五十元是整张单金额，不只是运费。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Which shop meets both the booking situation and collection deadline?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">便餐选择<br>今天临时决定请客，没有提前预订，饭菜必须六点半前取到。甲店六点可取，但必须前一天订。乙店今天订，六点二十可取。丙店不用预订，但最早七点取。三家都有现做的便餐。</p></div><p class="note">预订: book in advance</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲店</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 乙店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙店</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Shop B accepts a same-day order and collection before six thirty.</p><p class="cn">乙可当天订，又能六点半前取。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 乙店今天订，六点二十可取</p><ul><li>A: Shop A requires a prior-day booking that has not been made.<br>甲需要昨天预订，与没有提前订不符。</li><li>C: Shop C cannot provide collection early enough.<br>丙最早七点，超过期限。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. What will Xiaolin prepare for the visitor’s revised plan?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家庭消息<br>叔叔的车票从明天改到今晚，来不及留下吃晚饭。小林下午在家，妈妈请他把饭菜装进饭盒，六点交给叔叔带走。客房不用铺床了，叔叔今天不住下。小林答应先准备饭盒。</p></div><p class="note">客房: guest room</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 先给客房铺床</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 装好可以带走的饭菜</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 等待明天再准备饭菜</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The earlier departure requires a packed meal to take away.</p><p class="cn">提前离开，所以要准备能带走的饭菜。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 妈妈请他把饭菜装进饭盒，六点交给叔叔带走</p><ul><li>A: The message says the guest room no longer needs a bed prepared.<br>消息明确不住下，不用铺床。</li><li>C: The train is tonight, so waiting until tomorrow misses the need.<br>车票改为今晚，不能等明天。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. According to the latest forecast shown, what is expected this afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">预报更新<br>昨晚的消息说今天下午有大风。今早九点的新预报改为下午风弱，不下雨。负责人提醒小组以九点发布的预报为准，后续若再有变化会另发通知，先不要转发昨晚的旧消息。</p></div><p class="note">转发: forward a message</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 风弱，不下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 仍有昨晚说的大风</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一定会下大雨</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The newer nine-o’clock forecast states weak wind and no rain.</p><p class="cn">更新的九点预报说风弱、不下雨。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 今早九点的新预报改为下午风弱，不下雨</p><ul><li>B: Strong wind is the older forecast that has been replaced.<br>大风属于被替代的昨晚旧预报。</li><li>C: The new forecast says no rain, not heavy rain.<br>新预报明确不下雨。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. Why is the group not proceeding with today’s ride?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">骑行小组通知<br>今天的河边骑行取消，原因是预报有大风，负责人决定不按原计划组织。报名人数足够，老师也有空，自行车检查正常。请大家等新的日期通知，不要自己按旧时间到河边集合。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 预报有大风</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 报名的人太少</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 自行车没有检查好</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The stated reason is the strong-wind forecast.</p><p class="cn">通知明确说明原因是预报大风。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 原因是预报有大风</p><ul><li>B: The notice says enough people registered.<br>通知说报名人数足够。</li><li>C: The bicycles have passed their check.<br>自行车检查正常。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which option meets both requirements on the card?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">骑行物品卡<br>本次要求带普通白水，装在能盖紧的瓶子里。甲瓶装白水，有能拧紧的盖。乙杯也是白水，但没有盖。丙瓶有盖，里面却是果汁。小周要按物品卡选一份带走。</p></div><p class="note">拧紧: screw tight</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲瓶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 乙杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙瓶</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Bottle A has the specified drink and a secure lid.</p><p class="cn">甲既是白水，又有能盖紧的盖。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 甲瓶装白水，有能拧紧的盖</p><ul><li>B: Cup B lacks the required lid.<br>乙没有要求的盖子。</li><li>C: Bottle C contains juice instead of plain water.<br>丙装的是果汁，不是要求的白水。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What follows attaching the family photo to the card?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">中秋家庭贺卡步骤<br>先把全家合影贴在卡片中间，再请每位家人写一句话。大家都写好以后，把卡放进信封，第二天寄给远方的叔叔。没有写齐以前不要封口，免得漏掉谁的祝福。</p></div><p class="note">信封: envelope</p><p class="note">祝福: good wishes</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 马上封好信封</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 请每位家人写一句话</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 当天直接寄出</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The next step is collecting each family member’s message.</p><p class="cn">贴好照片后接着请每人写话。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 再请每位家人写一句话</p><ul><li>A: The envelope should not be sealed until all messages are included.<br>写齐前不要封口。</li><li>C: Mailing is planned for the next day after the card is complete.<br>卡完成后第二天才寄，不是当场直接寄。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What does Xiaolin’s behaviour suggest about the gathering?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林的中秋记录<br>今年亲戚从外地赶来，我买菜做饭忙了一个下午，确实很累。吃饭时看到大家终于坐在同一张桌旁，我忍不住笑了。晚上把合影存好，第二天又拿出来看，还发给了没能来的姐姐。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 他很珍惜这次团聚</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 他完全不愿意留下照片</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 他只记得自己累，没有开心过</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Smiling, saving and revisiting the photograph support valuing the reunion.</p><p class="cn">笑着保存并重看照片，支持珍惜团聚。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我忍不住笑了。晚上把合影存好，第二天又拿出来看</p><ul><li>B: He deliberately saves and shares the photograph.<br>他主动保存并分享合影。</li><li>C: The passage includes clear signs of pleasure despite tiredness.<br>虽然累，材料仍有明确的开心表现。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 20 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 20 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to changed shopping and dinner plans</h2><p>Reply to Xiaozhou in Chinese. Say whether you can collect the gift from the flower shop after six and whether dinner should be at home or at a restaurant near the market. Give a reason for your plan. Suggest another workable arrangement or ask one relevant question. You may invent details. About 40-60 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林：客人改到六点到站，还带着行李。我去接站，花店的礼物六点以后才能取。你能帮忙取吗？晚饭在家吃还是在市场旁的餐馆吃？我们重新安排一下吧。<br>小周</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">小周，我六点十分能取礼物，先送回家。晚饭在家吃吧，因为客人带着行李，在家方便些。你们几点能到家？我提前摆好桌子。</p></div><ul><li>Say whether you can collect the gift after six.</li><li>Choose dinner at home or a restaurant, or explain a feasible alternative.</li><li>Give a reason related to the plan.</li><li>Suggest an alternative arrangement or ask a relevant question.</li></ul><h3>Alternative example</h3><p class="cn">小周，我六点有课，不能去取。能请花店送来吗？晚饭选市场旁的餐馆吧，离车站近，客人不用等我们做饭。</p><ul><li>A refusal with a workable handover suggestion is acceptable.</li><li>Do not require dinner at home; a restaurant choice can be justified.</li><li>Added personal details may be fictional and must not contradict the collection time.</li></ul><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：Say whether you can collect the gift after six.；Choose dinner at home or a restaurant, or explain a feasible alternative.；Give a reason related to the plan.；Suggest an alternative arrangement or ask a relevant question.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Describe a family festival gathering</h2><p>Use the fictional card to describe last year’s family Mid-Autumn gathering. Include when and where, at least two actions in a consistent sequence, and a feeling or reason. Connected simple Chinese sentences are enough. About 80-120 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">时间：去年中秋晚上<br>地点：家里<br>饭前：全家一起摆桌子<br>晚饭时：接通视频，和外地姐姐聊天<br>饭后：分月饼、看全家照片<br>结束前：给姐姐拍一段祝福视频<br>感受：自己选择并说明</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">去年中秋晚上，我们全家在家里团聚。饭前大家先一起摆好桌子。姐姐在外地，晚饭时我们接通视频，一边吃饭一边和她聊天。饭后，我们分了月饼，还看了以前的全家照片。结束前，大家给姐姐拍了一段祝福视频。我觉得这次团聚很温暖，因为远方的家人也能一起参加。</p></div><ul><li>Identify last year’s Mid-Autumn evening.</li><li>Identify the family home.</li><li>Describe one action on the card.</li><li>Describe a second action in a consistent sequence.</li><li>Give a feeling or reason.</li></ul><ul><li>Feelings may differ if coherent with the described events.</li><li>Not every event must be included.</li><li>Do not demand a specific grammar pattern or any real family information.</li></ul><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：Identify last year’s Mid-Autumn evening.；Identify the family home.；Describe one action on the card.；Describe a second action in a consistent sequence.；Give a feeling or reason.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Plan purchases before visitors arrive</h2><p>A family member is planning shopping before guests arrive. Answer four fixed recorded prompts in Chinese. Each prompt plays twice, then allow 15 seconds to prepare and up to 25 seconds to record. Use real or invented details. All four responses form one task out of eight; the prompts do not adapt to your answer.</p><p>State a shopping need, choose something for the guests, explain the choice, and handle an earlier market closing time.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">家里明天有客人来，我们还需要买什么？请说一种东西，也可以说已经准备好了。</p><p class="cn">Example: 还需要买一点儿水果，茶叶已经有了。</p><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">招待客人，你想选水果还是点心？也可以选别的东西。</p><p class="cn">Example: 我想选水果，买一些橙子和苹果。</p><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">这个选择有什么好处？给我说一个和客人有关的理由吧。</p><p class="cn">Example: 因为客人坐了很久的车，想吃一点儿新鲜水果。</p><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">市场今天四点就关门，原来五点去来不及了。你准备怎么调整？</p><p class="cn">Example: 那我们三点去，先买好东西再回家等客人。</p><p class="cn">Alternative: 我三点有课，能去旁边晚上也营业的商店买吗？</p><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：Name a needed purchase or explain that preparations are complete.；Choose fruit, snacks or another relevant option.；Give a guest-related reason for the learner’s own choice.；Propose an earlier visit, another source or another feasible solution.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Compare two community activities</h2><p>Recommend one activity to a classmate who is free only on Sunday morning, wants to make a greeting card for a visiting grandparent and has no craft materials at home. Compare the options, state a choice, give two reasons using the cards and describe a short plan. If your choice changes the original goal, explain that change. Prepare for 60 seconds and speak for up to 90 seconds.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">社区周日活动<br>甲：手工教室贺卡课，上午九点到十点，二十元含全部材料；老师可以帮助写字，做好的卡可以带回家。<br>乙：阅览室故事会，上午九点到十点，免费；可以借一本故事书回家，没有手工材料，也不安排制作贺卡。<br>同学：只有上午有空，想亲手做贺卡送给来访的外婆，家中没有材料，两项活动的费用都能接受。</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">我建议参加甲。两个活动的时间都合适，乙免费，也能借书，但是没有做贺卡的环节。甲正好能让同学亲手做礼物，而且二十元已经包括材料，不用另外准备。我们可以八点五十分到手工教室，九点上课，十点带着卡回家送给外婆。</p></div><ul><li>Compare one or more features of both activities.</li><li>Choose an activity.</li><li>Give a first reason supported by the cards.</li><li>Give a second distinct reason supported by the cards.</li><li>Describe a feasible plan and explain any change to the original goal.</li></ul><h3>Alternative example</h3><p class="cn">如果同学愿意先陪外婆读故事，把做贺卡另作安排，可以考虑乙，因为免费，时间也合适。但这改变了当天亲手做贺卡的目标，要先确认同学同意。借回的书读完需要归还，不是买下的礼物。</p><ul><li>A directly meets the original card-making goal and materials need.</li><li>B can support a shared reading visit if the goal changes; a library book cannot be assumed to become an owned gift.</li><li>Shorter complete responses can earn full rubric credit; no native-accent requirement.</li></ul><h3>Task review criteria</h3><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务主要观察点：Compare one or more features of both activities.；Choose an activity.；Give a first reason supported by the cards.；Give a second distinct reason supported by the cards.；Describe a feasible plan and explain any change to the original goal.</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Scoring rubric" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>已提交内容没有回应相关任务。</td><td>回应部分要求，但遗漏或误解关键信息。</td><td>完成本任务列出的主要要求，理由或安排与情境一致。</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>主要意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分意思需猜测，个别错误影响理解。</td><td>主要意思清楚；允许不影响理解的错误和口音。</td></tr><tr><td>语言运用</td><td>缺少可表达任务意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句可表达部分意思，但关系不够清楚。</td><td>能用简单中文和必要连接表达多项信息，不要求指定句型。</td></tr><tr><td>组织和相关回应</td><td>缺少可辨顺序或相关回应。</td><td>部分顺序或回应相关，但连接不清。</td><td>多句内容易于跟随，先后或比较关系清楚，回应相关。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></main></body></html>